Star schema
A star schema has one central fact table (Fact_Sales) joined directly to denormalized dimension
tables. Each dimension is a single flat table, so the diagram looks like a star. It keeps data in a
denormalized form (not normalized beyond 2NF), so city, state, category and month sit inside one
table.

